invalid type: string "深度润滑（拆机臂·grease内腔）Deep Lubrication\n1. Routine Maintenance\nSpray WD40 or ordinary engine oil on the stainless steel moving rod.\nIn cold climates (1°C / 30°F or below):\nSpray every 4–6 weeks to prevent freeze‑up.\n2. Deep Lubrication (if movement is not smooth)\nIf the arm still does not run smoothly after routine maintenance, further lubricate: